# The MD-CNN reproduction. Its code and parameter files are tracked; everything
# it produces is not (training_output/ — saved Keras models, ~175 MB, and the
# per-fold AUC / history CSVs).
#
# model_training/*.py is reference code copied verbatim from the authors'
# working tree — worth having in git precisely BECAUSE it is a copy: our single
# deviation from it (start_cv_fold read from the parameter file) is otherwise
# invisible, and the public Big-TB-benchmark copy cannot run on the real data
# as shipped.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!*.sh
!*.py
!*.txt
